		{"id":"d3921788d2f5a0a2","x":-450,"y":-294,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"[[Session Canvases.base]]\n#Session_Canvas"},
		{"id":"2f59b4c5877ae8cf","x":-480,"y":-200,"width":685,"height":190,"type":"text","text":"V\n\"Welcome home I will say I am impressed you escaped from that vampires claws. How funny no matter what you do you can never keep those closest to you alive … I know why you returned I know who you want to find know that I want to find her too, soon enough The Dreamers Heart will fall into my lap and with it that barrier. I hope you enjoyed your vacation I have been waiting.\""},
		{"id":"bd842a3b28168810","x":-500,"y":20,"width":705,"height":220,"type":"text","text":"Alivia will tell them that she is happy that for the most part they are ok.\n\nAnd Elly will be standing in the room as they return\n\n(Note: get really into character for Elly I need to make the tensions high right away)\n\n\nAlso in the room is Achillies \n\n\nEveryone will need to have a conversation about what happened and what to do next."},
		{"id":"a8304cc28e4f4af7","x":-500,"y":260,"width":720,"height":180,"type":"text","text":"Azest is currently flying over the ocean towards Wildfort in hopes of finding the old Temple of the Undying One. She is hoping to discover any secrets she can about him and his magic in hopes to find the spell he used to create the dolls bound to Solaris\n\nAzest will be last seen at the Menagrie Coast.\n"}
	],
